;
SHEET
DETERMINATION METHOD: DSSP
THE SHEET STRUCTURE OF THIS ASSEMBLY IS COMPRISED OF
FIVE SHEETS THAT FORM AN EQUATORIAL GIRDLE AROUND THE
DECAMERIC ASSEMBLY. EACH SHEET IS MADE UP OF FOUR STRANDS
FROM TWO PROTEIN CHAINS EACH CONTRIBUTING TWO STRANDS
;
